#: ../../source/docs/boat-configuration.rst:10
#: 377cf9ddfac6420e9048c97b1890be46
msgid ""
"Boats can also be controlled with the standard Rover firmware.  To specify "
"that the vehicle is a boat the :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` parameter "
"should be set to 2 (Boat)."
msgstr ""
"船也可以使用标准 Rover 固件进行控制。要将车辆指定为船，需将 :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 参数设置为 "
"2（船）。"

